    "category": "agent",
    "danger": "confirm",
    "dangerRationale": "Permanently removes the durable bookmark; the session demotes to ordinary history and may then age out. The provider transcript is untouched.",
    "description": "Remove a bookmark, demoting its session back to ordinary time-limited history where retention can eventually age it out. The provider's own transcript and any open pane are untouched, so this deletes the pin rather than the conversation — but the pin itself does not come back, and the session may be gone by the time anyone looks again. Confirmation is enforced by the dispatch layer.",
