    "category": "worktree",
    "danger": "safe",
    "dangerRationale": undefined,
    "description": "Move keyboard focus to the agent most in need of attention, preferring one blocked on the user over one merely working. Use this to triage a fleet by hand. It changes what the user sees, and reports whether anything was focused, which state that agent was in, and how many are waiting or working — read an agent status snapshot for the state of each terminal.",
